    "ImageDescription": {
      "value": "A cropped image of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Joseph_Stalin\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Joseph Stalin\">Joseph Stalin</a> during the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tehran_Conference\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Tehran Conference\">Tehran Conference</a>. In the full photo he is sitting beside <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Franklin_D._Roosevelt\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Franklin D. Roosevelt\">Franklin D. Roosevelt</a>, and <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Winston_Churchill\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Winston Churchill\">Winston Churchill</a> on the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Portico\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Portico\">portico</a> of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Diplomatic_missions_of_Russia\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Diplomatic missions of Russia\">Russian Embassy</a>.",
